      <h1>Top 10 Embroidered Hoodie Manufacturers in China: A Buyer's Guide to Choosing the Right Factory</h1>
      <p class="ar-meta">
        <span>By <strong rel="author">YAUUM Sourcing Team</strong></span>
        <span>Published <time datetime="2026-10-07">October 7, 2026</time></span>
        <span class="ar-views" data-views-for="/top-10-embroidered-hoodie-manufacturers-china/" data-views-hit></span>
      </p>
      <p class="ar-lede">Sourcing an embroidered hoodie is not the same job as sourcing a plain one. The blank garment is the easy part. Embroidery is where orders go sideways: stitch density that puckers a 280 GSM fleece, thread colors that drift two shades off your brand palette, a 3D puff logo that flattens after one 40°C wash. This guide covers the criteria that actually separate capable factories from the rest, then walks through ten manufacturers worth putting on a shortlist.</p>
